'''Brambleghast''' (Japanese: '''アノホラグサ''' ''Anohoragusa'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

