==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Brambleghast|24}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*'''Continuous Tumble''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Miltank|94}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

